diff:1184963752:1184963343:=1,13d0%0a%3c http://banto.hipatia.info/softwarelivre/ocara.html\\%0a%3c Ocara é um gerenciador de telecentros. É necessário ter instalado na máquina servidora apache2, mysql e php5. Ver [[http://banto.hipatia.info/softwarelivre/lamp.html|lamp]]\\%0a%3c Pegue o pacote:\\%0a%3c [@$ wget -c http://banto.hipatia.info/softwarelivre/arquivos/ocara-1.1-7_all-bto.deb@]\\%0a%3c ou aqui [[http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/anexo/ocara-1.1-7_all-bto.deb|ocara-1.1-7_all-bto.deb]]%0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c instale:\\%0a%3c [@# apt-get install dialog@]\\%0a%3c [@# dpkg -i ocara-1.1-7_all.deb@]\\%0a%3c %0a%3c %0a%3c %0a
